d Signature of Author","x":258,"y":2722,"w":749,"h":44},{"text":"GUMENT AUTHOR(S):","x":1292,"y":2421,"w":459,"h":44},{"text":"'8/18/2026","x":1719,"y":2510,"w":200,"h":35},{"text":"Date","x":1898,"y":2576,"w":89,"h":34},{"text":"Date","x":1898,"y":2727,"w":89,"h":34},{"text":"40 Tower Road, San Mateo, CA 94402","x":872,"y":2819,"w":689,"h":37},{"text":"P 650.312.5222 F 650.312.5348 email registrar@smcacre.gov web www.smcacre.gov","x":427,"y":2868,"w":1582,"h":43}]},{"page":6,"width":2448,"height":3168,"lines":[{"text":"q","x":142,"y":850,"w":39,"h":50},{"text":"16","x":87,"y":991,"w":62,"h":49},{"text":"5","x":129,"y":1192,"w":42,"h":51},{"text":"(3","x":115,"y":1355,"w":78,"h":49},{"text":"IL-I","x":109,"y":1425,"w":65,"h":55},{"text":"6","x":131,"y":1667,"w":34,"h":46},{"text":"16","x":108,"y":1888,"w":59,"h":45},{"text":"6","x":108,"y":1969,"w":47,"h":70},{"text":"5","x":103,"y":2160,"w":47,"h":63},{"text":"5","x":79,"y":2262,"w":45,"h":60},{"text":"LOD (V","x":77,"y":2483,"w":142,"h":64},{"text":"REBUTTAL TO ARGUMENT AGAINST MEASURE P","x":706,"y":356,"w":939,"h":35},{"text":"Don't be fooled by misleading claims. Vote YES! on Measure P to meet our housing goals","x":280,"y":545,"w":1729,"h":42},{"text":"without sacrificing our downtown.","x":277,"y":610,"w":667,"h":39},{"text":"As long-time Menlo Park residents and civic leaders, we're committed to affordable","x":276,"y":701,"w":1635,"h":43},{"text":"housing. Together, we can do it right.","x":280,"y":766,"w":710,"h":43},{"text":"Measure P enables a more reliable path to affordable homes.","x":280,"y":861,"w":1261,"h":41},{"text":"Council's plan is already failing. We have better options. More than 1 , 750 additional homes","x":279,"y":927,"w":1782,"h":43},{"text":"are being planned on major sites near downtown. And talks are underway to convert the","x":279,"y":992,"w":1719,"h":44},{"text":"25-acre office park off Marsh Rd. to housing. Let's work with those developers to make","x":279,"y":1056,"w":1687,"h":45},{"text":"more units affordable. It would be less costly, and less damaging, than building from","x":280,"y":1121,"w":1648,"h":42},{"text":"scratch on tiny, congested plazas.","x":279,"y":1190,"w":663,"h":42},{"text":"Measure P keeps our downtown accessible.","x":280,"y":1286,"w":905,"h":41},{"text":"The parking plazas support our community and the viability of our downtown. Measure P","x":276,"y":1378,"w":1731,"h":46},{"text":"gives you a vote before they're converted into urban-style, 6-8 story high-rises, with","x":278,"y":1444,"w":1622,"h":46},{"text":"insufficient parking for the new residents, and no explanation of who'd pay to replace the","x":280,"y":1509,"w":1735,"h":44},{"text":"current public parking - taxpayers would be on the hook for N$50M.","x":280,"y":1572,"w":1306,"h":49},{"text":"Measure P is simple and reasonable.","x":281,"y":1673,"w":758,"h":43},{"text":"Measure P doesn't block development on the plazas — it merely requires voter approval. It","x":282,"y":1767,"w":1747,"h":43},{"text":"expressly allows improvements to the \"availability, access, or convenience\" of parking -","x":281,"y":1832,"w":1707,"h":48},{"text":"without a vote. And it applies only to the plazas - it doesn't hinder downtown improvements","x":279,"y":1898,"w":1790,"h":45},{"text":"that are so badly needed.","x":279,"y":1971,"w":497,"h":41},{"text":"Vote YES! on Measure P to ensure our community's voice is heard.","x":280,"y":2064,"w":1294,"h":40},{"text":"Trust the people of Menlo Park.","x":280,"y":2161,"w":606,"h":42},{"text":"For a point-by-point rebuttal: Yes-on-P.com","x":285,"y":2256,"w":842,"h":43},{"text":"RECEIVED","x":1582,"y":2511,"w":381,"h":68},{"text":"AUG 18 2026","x":1647,"y":2681,"w":256,"h":45},{"text":"City of Menlo Park","x":1528,"y":2812,"w":512,"h":55},{"text":"City Clerk's Office","x":1535,"y":2884,"w":494,"h":56},{"text":"15","x":2176,"y":964,"w":53,"h":54},{"text":"5","x":2176,"y":1163,"w":46,"h":53},{"text":"5","x":2170,"y":1241,"w":40,"h":45},{"text":"15","x":2198,"y":1493,"w":55,"h":52},{"text":"13","x":2193,"y":1742,"w":60,"h":53},{"text":"15","x":2193,"y":1895,"w":67,"h":49},{"text":"5","x":2213,"y":1960,"w":36,"h":53},{"text":"9","x":2192,"y":2148,"w":43,"h":37},{"text":"5","x":2169,"y":2214,"w":47,"h":49}]}]}
